ter project data or access freelancer settings.\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"How does the Smart AI Brief feature work?\",{\"className\":\"collapse collapse-arrow rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-title text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"How does the Smart AI Brief feature work?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-content leading-7 text-base-content/70\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Simply paste raw client chat history, emails, or call notes into EntroSync. The AI analyzes the text to generate a structured PRD, scope of work, and recommended milestones that you can adopt with one click.\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Can freelancers issue invoices and export PDFs?\",{\"className\":\"collapse collapse-arrow rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-title text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Can freelancers issue invoices and export PDFs?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-content leading-7 text-base-content/70\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Yes. You can generate professional invoices based on completed milestones or custom items, track status (Pending / Paid), and let clients view or download PDF invoices directly inside their portal.\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Can I manage multiple client projects at once?\",{\"className\":\"collapse collapse-arrow rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-title text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Can I manage multiple client projects at once?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-content leading-7 text-base-content/70\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Absolutely. Freelancers have a centralized dashboard to manage all projects, track pending payouts across clients, and issue magic links for each active account.\"}]}]]