apse-title text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"How do clients access their project portal?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-content leading-7 text-base-content/70\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Freelancers generate a unique magic link (e.g. /client/:token) for each project. Clients open the link directly on desktop or mobile without needing to register, log in, or remember a password.\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Is the client portal secure and read-only?\",{\"className\":\"collapse collapse-arrow rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-title text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Is the client portal secure and read-only?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-content leading-7 text-base-content/70\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Yes! The client portal is strictly read-only by design. Clients can view project progress, milestones, tasks, documents, logs, and invoices, but cannot alter project data or access freelancer settings.\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"How does the Smart AI Brief feature work?\",{\"className\":\"collapse collapse-arrow rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-title text-lg font-semibold\",\"children\":\"How does the Smart AI Brief feature work?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-content leading-7 text-base-content/70\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Simply paste raw client chat history, emails, or call notes into EntroSync. The AI analyzes the text to generate a structured PRD, scope of work, and recommended milestones that you can adopt with one click.\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"Can freelancers issue invoices and export PDFs?\",{\"className\":\"collapse collapse-arrow rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"collapse-title text-lg font-semibo